# raid_takeover (kenshi-h2v.22.2; docs/reference/FACTIONS.md 2.1b, SCENARIO_IMPORT.md `town` / `raid` / `war`). food_raid's Old Village, made the player's, with a Crab
# Raiders force 400 u out and no campaign (the 'Crab Raider standard raid' pushes a loot phase and has no victory AI, so it never reaches the stay): the squad runs its
# template's 'passing town assault then occupy' and 'hostile occupy town'. One player character; the crabs are at war with her faction. Old Village has no walls, so the
# occupiers' throw-out (273 / 274, bodies inside the walls only) has nothing to throw her out of: she is downed and left lying. The town's owner never changes.
